Error [E1003]: A `U8` holds 0..255
  --> tests/ui/number_name_does_not_fit.jet:7:17
    |
  7 |     print(take8(big))
    |                 ^^^
  --> tests/ui/number_name_does_not_fit.jet:6:10
    |
  6 |     big: 300
    |          ^^^ `big` is this number
 Why: Binary APIs use one byte per value
 Fix: Use a number from 0 through 255
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1003
